    <td>I10</td><td>S — Synthetic risk factor; no blood pressure from her lifetime is recorded in the cited sources.</td>
  </tr>
  <tr ID="problem-4">
    <td>Paroxysmal atrial fibrillation found on 30-day ambulatory monitoring after the stroke (six episodes, the longest 3 hours 10 minutes; burden about 3%); CHA2DS2-VASc 6, HAS-BLED 2</td><td>active</td><td>confirmed</td>
    <td>I48.0</td><td>S — Synthetic finding on prolonged rhythm monitoring at five weeks.</td>
